# PyJWT 2.9.0 → 2.12.0. RFC 7515 §4.1.11 MUST violation: PyJWT accepts
# unknown `crit` header extensions. Fix: pin `PyJWT>=2.12.0` in root
# `requirements.txt`. Already noted in accept-with-rationale's
# trivy-prescan-2026-05-11 entry as "patched" — patch landed in seed
# images but the root requirements.txt was not bumped.
CVE-2026-32597

# lodash 4.17.21 / 4.17.23 → 4.18.0. Arbitrary code execution via
# untrusted input in template imports. Fix: bump in product frontend
# package-lock.json files (erp-imobiliario, personal-finance,
# therapy-platform). One CVE ID covers all three lockfiles.
CVE-2026-4800

# @remix-run/router 1.23.0 → 1.23.2. Fix: bump in erp-imobiliario
# frontend lockfile (only product using @remix-run/router).
CVE-2026-22029

# glob 10.4.5 → 11.1.0 / 10.5.0. Fix: bump in erp-imobiliario frontend.
CVE-2025-64756

# minimatch 9.0.5 → 9.0.6 / 9.0.7. Three CVEs covering ReDoS variants.
